[Host] It means an announcement.

24
00:03:26,728 --> 00:03:37,144
[Slow] 遠隔手術は、離れた場所にいる医師が、ロボットを操作して手術をする方法です。

25
00:03:37,943 --> 00:03:43,800
[Host] Remote surgery is when a doctor in a distant place operates a robot to perform surgery.

26
