[Host] The two hospitals are about thirty kilometers apart and are connected by a communication line.

32
00:04:13,096 --> 00:04:16,072
[Vocab] 通信回線

33
00:04:16,471 --> 00:04:18,656
[Host] It means a communication line.

34
